<title>ST VINCENT AND THE GRENADINES: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 94-5 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA, SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 94-5 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA, SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 94 for five at lunch on the opening day of the second test against Sri Lanka at Arnos Vale on Friday.</p>
